# Bind-mounted at runtime (docker-compose.yml) — baking them into the image is wasted work.
# Only the genuinely dynamic/runtime parts of public/ are listed here, NOT the whole
# directory: public/brand (and anything else static) must ship baked into the image,
# otherwise it depends entirely on the host's ./public already being correctly seeded.
